---
import SubpageLayout from '../../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import directoryData from '../../data/directory.json';
---

<SubpageLayout title="Key Contacts" description="Important government offices and public services in the Republic of Nauru, organised by what you need them for." sectionEmoji="📞" sectionLabel="Directory" includeTopBar={true} includeFooter={true}>
  <p>Use this directory when you need a real-world contact rather than a broad description. The grouped cards below are designed to tell you what each office is for, when you need it, and where it fits into a trip or research workflow.</p>

  <h2>Emergency & urgent help</h2>
  <div class="contact-grid">
    <div class="contact-card"><h4>🚨 Police</h4><p>Emergency: 110 · Non-emergency: +674 557 3122</p><p>Use for urgent safety, reporting incidents and lost property.</p></div>
    <div class="contact-card"><h4>🏥 Hospital</h4><p>Emergency: 112 · Appointments: +674 557 3150</p><p>Use for medical help, treatment and general health questions.</p></div>
    <div class="contact-card"><h4>🔥 Fire Service</h4><p>Emergency: 111</p><p>Use for fire, smoke or immediate hazard response.</p></div>
    <div class="contact-card"><h4>✈️ Airport</h4><p>Nauru International Airport (INU)</p><p>Use for arrivals, departures and transfer coordination.</p></div>
  </div>

  <h2>Government offices</h2>
  <div class="contact-grid">
    {directoryData.map(entry => (
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h4>{entry.icon} {entry.name}</h4>
        <p>{entry.detail}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2>When to use the directory</h2>
  <div class="utility-grid">
    <a href="/visit/visa/" class="utility-card"><h3>Before travel</h3><p>Check visa and immigration touchpoints.</p></a>
    <a href="/visit/transport/" class="utility-card"><h3>On arrival</h3><p>Coordinate transfer or local transport.</p></a>
    <a href="/about/" class="utility-card"><h3>Background</h3><p>Understand institutions and country context.</p></a>
    <a href="/news/" class="utility-card"><h3>Current context</h3><p>Look at announcements and updates.</p></a>
  </div>

  <div class="info-box">
    <h4>📌 Practical note</h4>
    <p>Contact details can change. Use the directory as a starting point, then verify the latest details with the relevant office before you depend on them.</p>
  </div>
</SubpageLayout>

<style>
  .contact-grid,.utility-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:1rem 0 2rem}
  .contact-card,.utility-card{border:2px solid #1a1a2e;background:#fff;padding:18px;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #1a1a2e;display:block}
  .contact-card h4,.utility-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#002B7F}
  .contact-card p{margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.7;color:#475569}
  @media (max-width: 720px){.contact-grid,.utility-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
